# GuidePoint — environment template (optional)
# Copy this file to `.env` only if YOUR tooling expects it locally.
# The Flutter mobile app does **not** require a `.env` file for default operation.
#
# Sensitive values MUST stay out of Git. Use placeholders like below.

# Optional: Hosted building map fetch (when QR payloads use an absolute HTTPS URL instead of raw JSON).
# The app uses Flutter `http`; no secrets required for anonymous GET of public JSON maps.
GUIDEPOINT_MAP_JSON_URL=

# Future: If you deploy a Scene CNN or map API requiring auth — document here.
# GUIDEPOINT_CLASSIFY_ENDPOINT=https://api.example.com/v1/classify
# GUIDEPOINT_API_KEY='EXAMPLE_API_KEY'

# Android release signing — never commit real values; use `flutter_app/android/key.properties`
# STORE_PASSWORD='EXAMPLE_STORE_PASSWORD'
# KEY_ALIAS='your_key_alias'
